OL,3,GNEWSAAir ambulance charities battling
OL,4,Arising fuel costs
OL,5,
OL,6,FAir ambulance charities in the East of
OL,7,FEngland said the rising cost of fuel
OL,8,Fwas putting pressure on their
OL,9,Flife-saving services.
OL,11,FCambridgeshire-based Magpas said
OL,12,Fsoaring costs had created an unexpected
OL,13,F#50,000 gap in its budget.
OL,15,FExecutive medical director Simon Lewis
OL,16,Fsaid the organisation, which also
OL,17,Fserves counties such as Bedfordshire
OL,18,Fand Northamptonshire, was paying about
OL,19,Ftwice as much as what it had budgeted
OL,20,Ffor fuel.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
