OL,3,GNEWSAAir ambulance charities battling
OL,4,Arising fuel costs
OL,5,
OL,6,FOther charities that serve Essex,
OL,7,FHertfordshire, Norfolk and Suffolk told
OL,8,Fthe BBC they were facing similar
OL,9,Fchallenges. The government said it
OL,10,Fwould continue to work with fuel
OL,11,Fsuppliers to address issues.
